{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The motto of W.A.PU Space Orderty is \u2014 running a business doesn't have to be a hassle or tiring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/47390ea2a6a18a5bf0863ab6e63fe0d0.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just launched your very own interstellar freight venture. Each day holds a simple joy: stacking parcels with care, ensuring the cargo ship lifts off steady, and reaping the rewards of a job well done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1246 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/8000901d07ef75fe4ba29a003b1c0132.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stir the vintage cargo management system to life whenever you wish; spruce up your vessel with a quick upgrade; and wonder, who shall don the captain\u2019s hat today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/e5e6f531fd1c777f8c6d9e1d7d473314.avif?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lonely expanse of stars, what tales of longing and sentiment linger within each freight  Email?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.poster.avif?t=1754640190\" width=1600 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.webm?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/2fada9f938288308ed55791bb077cf93.mp4?t=1754640190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might these small, steady efforts be enough to help your sister\u2014always ready to lend a hand\u2014chase her dream of forming a band?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.avif?t=1754640190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809220/extras_big/119eee77c4712c0dc68977e3f75adb76.webp?t=1754640190 width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, may you pause or return as you please, mastering your time in a universe that never hurries.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Captain Oi Wa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809220/2a85b66d8809ac16837b82ce28fe5804cbb219b7.jpg"},{"name":"Kid Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809220/f67583107289d74961663ade0d342dc0aeffa9e0.jpg"},{"name":"D.R.A.Green.L.A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809220/fa012d8ff976960